  "body": "Skip to main content\nSwiss caviar skincare\n\nFour formulas. One complete ritual.\n\nView the four formulas\nThe four formulas\n\nEach made for one step, each complete on its own. Choose one, or follow all four.\n\nStep\n01\nCleanse\n\nMicellar Water\nAll‑in‑One Cleanser\n\nRemoves make‑up & replenishes lipids\n\n€55\nfor\n150 ml\n\nADD TO BAG\n\nStep\n02\nTreat\n\nAdvanced Repair\nSerum\n\nVisibly firms & smooths\n\n€150\nfor\n30 ml\n\nADD TO BAG\n\nStep\n03\nRevive\n\nRevitalizing\nEye Cream\n\nSoftens the look of dark circles & fine lines\n\n€145\nfor\n15 ml\n\nADD TO BAG\n\nStep\n04\nRestore\n\n24h Regeneration\nCream\n\nLasting hydration & barrier support\n\n€150\nfor\n50 ml\n\nADD TO BAG\n\nTHE COMPLETE RITUAL\n\nThe four formulas, as one ritual.\n\nCleanse to restore, presented together: one considered routine for morning and evening.\n\nStep\n01\nCleanse\nMicellar Water All‑in‑One Cleanser\nStep\n02\nTreat\nAdvanced Repair Serum\nStep\n03\nRevive\nRevitalizing Eye Cream\nStep\n04\nRestore\n24h Regeneration Cream\nPrice:€450\n€500 bought separately;you save €50\nAdd to bag\nDiscover the ritual\n\nFree worldwide shipping30-day returns\n\nBuilt as one system\n\nThis collection is made for the visible signs of ageing (fine lines, dullness, dryness and loss of firmness) as a considered daily ritual rather than a shelf of disconnected products. Every formula draws from the same High-Tech Complex, in concentrations suited to each step’s role, and each product’s study results are published on the Clinical Studies page.\n\nHow the ritual works\nIngredients and clinical evidence\nWhich product should I start with?\n\nThe Caviar Circle\n\nRitual guidance, product news and brand updates.\n\nEmail address\nJOIN THE CAVIAR CIRCLE\nI agree to receive communications from Caviar of Switzerland. Privacy Policy.\n\nMade in Switzerland\nFree worldwide shipping\n30-day returns\nSecure checkout\nCUSTOMER CARE\nEXPLORE\nTHE HOUSE IN ZUG\n\n© 2026 Caviar of Switzerland. All rights reserved.\n\nZUG, SWITZERLAND",
